# README.md, CHANGELOG.md, LICENSE, and TROUBLESHOOTING.md (opened by the
# "Troubleshooting & Written Guide" command, so it MUST ship).
.claude/
.vscode/
review/
test/

# Internal notes and specs — the user-facing docs are README + TROUBLESHOOTING
DOGFOODING.md
DESIGN-*.md
SPEC-*.md
CORE-CONCEPTS.md

